    "body": "Skip to main content\nPDFPilot\nMerge PDF\nSplit PDF\nCompress PDF\nConvert PDF\nAll Tools\nGuides\nAbout\nEnglish\nPDF to Word\nmixed-input.pdf · 3 pages\n1\nReplace PDF file\n14.87 KB · 3 pages\n1\n\nmixed-input.pdf\n\n3 pages · 14.87 KB\n\nPDF to Word\n\nEditable DOCX output\n\nAuto mode keeps selectable text and uses free English OCR for each image-only page, including scanned pages mixed with selectable text.\n\nAuto\nRECOMMENDED\n\nBest choice for normal and scanned PDFs. Uses OCR only when needed.\n\nFree OCR\nFREE\n\nForce OCR for scanned/image-only PDFs. Slower, but works when text is not selectable.\n\nNo OCR\n\nFast conversion for PDFs that already have selectable text.\n\nWord output extracts text and readable structure. Complex layouts, exact fonts, and tables may still need light review after conversion.\n\nConvert to WORD\nPDF templates and workflows (English)\nPDF to Word on Mac\nScanned PDF to Word with OCR\nBrowse all related tasks\nHow to use PDF to Word\n\nExtract selectable text or use English OCR to produce editable Word paragraphs.\n\nInput: application/pdf. Output: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document.\n\nSelect a PDF.\nChoose the available text extraction or OCR mode.\nConvert and download Word, then proofread the output.\nProcessing, privacy and limitations\nHow are my files processed?\nFiles are processed in your browser; this tool does not upload the selected file for processing.\nWhat limitations should I check?\nComplex layout is not reconstructed faithfully. English OCR depends on local WebAssembly worker support.\nPDF to Word on Mac\nScanned PDF to Word with OCR\nPDFPilot\n\nPDF tools for everyday document tasks.\n\nPOPULAR TOOLS\nPDF to JPG\nJPG to PDF\nWord to PDF\nPowerPoint to PDF\nExcel to PDF\nCATEGORIES\nCompress & Optimize PDFs\nMerge PDF Tools\nSplit PDF Tools\nPDF to JPG",
